5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to verify if past projects actually met user expectations before approving new ones.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how much disruption the construction causes to daily academic schedules.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The calendar is already tight; I worry about how many weeks we actually have left.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know if the prices we agreed on are still realistic today.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Who is left to maintain this once the contractors finally leave the site?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, price stability is vital, but we must also check if the facilities were actually used.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
