13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Victoria, if we cannot afford the upkeep, the initial savings are meaningless to me.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Benjamin, out-of-service time is a symptom, not the cause. The cause is the lack of hands.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will look into post-occupancy reviews to see what users actually thought of the last builds.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I need to check the timetable records to quantify the exact loss of teaching time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will examine the weather days in the site diaries to understand external delays.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the tender records to see if the budget figures have drifted.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at staffing posts and the bench technicians' routines to see the real load.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let us gather these facts before we commit to a single plan.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. Data on disruption is essential for a fair comparison.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I hope the diaries show more than just rain; I suspect systemic slippage.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I am worried the paper numbers are already outdated by the time we vote.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"If the staff are already drowning, adding more maintenance is a recipe for failure.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
